            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a soft suture anchor construct (10), comprising an all-suture anchor (20) extending along a longitudinal axis and having two ends (22, 24) positioned in a first direction in a pre-deployment configuration, and wherein the two ends (22, 24) are positioned in a second direction different from the first direction in a deployed configuration, further comprising a filament (30) woven through the all-suture anchor (20) at a plurality of passing locations.It is proposed that that the filament (30) has two ends (32, 32), at least one of which extends from a first passing location proximate to one of the two ends (22, 24) of the all-suture anchor (20).</p>
            </abstract>
